rs/logos/footer/share-email-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Email this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47651077.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-sms-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Text this Story\"></a></td></tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      \r\n<tr><td height=\"20\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ol-adpad\" style=\"padding: 20px 3.5% 0 3.5%;\"><p class=\"b\"\r\nstyle=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; font-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #008dc8; font-weight:700;\"\r\n>\r\nA MESSAGE FROM SUNTORY\r\n</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 3.5%; line-height: 1.5;\"><span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #222222;  font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;\">Water is one of nature’s greatest gifts</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47651077.422300/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc3VudG9yeS5jb20vYWJvdXQtdXMvcGFzc2lvbi1mb3Itd2F0ZXIvP2F4aW9zX2FkbGluaz0xJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB25c923fc\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tpc.googlesyndication.com/pageadimg/imgad?id=CICAgJDV6J3B6wEQARgBKAEyCA6QzCKYI7Fe\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p>For more than 100 years, water has been essential to Suntory’s beverages and craftsmanship, shaping the organization’s deep respect for it as a shared resource.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Looking ahead:</strong> Suntory is applying water science to help protect this resource for future generations.</p>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47651077.422300/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc3VudG9yeS5jb20vYWJvdXQtdXMvcGFzc2lvbi1mb3Itd2F0ZXIvP2F4aW9zX2FkbGluaz0xJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC25c923fc\" target=\"_blank\">See how.</a></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🍽️ Dinner with a view </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/4eRoW54ZRT6N1kBxBrm_aVeD65E=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/24/1790282816000.jpeg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='487' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/4eRoW54ZRT6N1kBxBrm_aVeD65E=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/24/1790282816000.jpeg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">Photo: Ashley Corso</div><p><strong>The view during </strong>reader A